o</surname><given-names>MG</given-names></name><name><surname>Motto</surname><given-names>MA</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>1989</year><article-title>Anopheline species, some of their habits and relation to malaria in endemic areas of Rond&#x000f4;nia State, Amazon Region of Brazil.</article-title><source>Mem Inst Oswaldo Cruz</source><volume>84</volume><fpage>501</fpage><lpage>514</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">2487447</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="pone.0009245-LourenodeOliveira2"><label>19</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Louren&#x000e7;o-de-Oliveira</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Luz</surname><given-names>SLB</given-names></name></person-group><year>1996</year><article-title>Simiam malaria at two Sites in the Brazilian Amazon&#x02013;II Vertical Distribuition and frequency of Anopheline Species Inside and Outside the Forest.</article-title><source>Mem Inst Oswaldo Cruz</source><volume>91(6)</volume><fpage>687</fpage><lpage>694</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9283645</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="pone.0009245-Tadei1"><label>20</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Tadei</surname><given-names>WP</given-names></name></person-group><year>1986</year><article-title>Biologia de anofelinos Amaz&#x000f4;nicos, XI. Estudos em populac&#x000f5;es de Anopheles e controle da malaria em Ariquemes, Rond&#x000f4;nia.</article-title><source>Acta Amaz&#x000f4;nica</source><volume>16/17(supl)</volume><fpage>151</fpage><lpage>67</lpage></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="pone.0009245-Tadei2"><label>21</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Tadei</surname><given-names>WP</given-names></name><name><surname>Santos</surname><given-names>JMM</given-names></name><name><surname>Costa</surname><given-names>WLS</given-names